⚡️🇪🇬 The House of Representatives session that was announced today to discuss supporting Saudi Arabia militarily was supposedly extended for two more days to allow the largest number of members of parliament to speak and complete their statements regarding Egypt's supportive stance towards Saudi Arabia.

So far, there is no official announcement that Egypt will be or not be a part of the war until all requirements are met, other than "providing support of every kind" such as diplomatic support.

@medmannews

— 🇾🇪/🇸🇦 WATCH: Footage released by the Houthis shows the targeting and downing of a Saudi AH-6i attack helicopter near Najran on October 18.

According to the statement, the helicopter was struck with a locally produced surface-to-air missile while carrying out operations in the border area.

